From: Aether Team <dev@aetherbrowser.org>
Date: Sat, 31 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0001] feat(identity): rename Brave to Aether in product branding

Renames all user-visible instances of "Brave" to "Aether" in the core
branding and string resource files. This patch establishes Aether as a
distinct product identity built on the Brave/Chromium foundation.

Changes:
- brave/app/theme/brave/BRANDING: company and product name constants
- brave/app/brave_strings.grd: IDS_PRODUCT_NAME and related strings
- brave/common/brave_channel_info.cc: internal channel product name

IMPORTANT: This patch was generated from known Brave source structure.
Run `git apply --check` after cloning Brave to verify context lines.
If any hunk fails, regenerate from the live source using:
  tools/scripts/generate-identity-patch.ps1

---
 brave/app/theme/brave/BRANDING       | 10 +++++-----
 brave/app/brave_strings.grd          |  6 +++---
 brave/common/brave_channel_info.cc   |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/brave/app/theme/brave/BRANDING b/brave/app/theme/brave/BRANDING
--- a/brave/app/theme/brave/BRANDING
+++ b/brave/app/theme/brave/BRANDING
@@ -1,10 +1,10 @@
-COMPANY_FULLNAME=Brave Software Inc.
-COMPANY_SHORTNAME=BraveSoftware
-PRODUCT_FULLNAME=Brave Browser
-PRODUCT_SHORTNAME=Brave-Browser
-PRODUCT_INSTALLER_FULLNAME=Brave
+COMPANY_FULLNAME=Aether
+COMPANY_SHORTNAME=Aether
+PRODUCT_FULLNAME=Aether Browser
+PRODUCT_SHORTNAME=Aether-Browser
+PRODUCT_INSTALLER_FULLNAME=Aether
 BROWSER_APP_GENERIC_NAME=Web Browser
-APP_SPECIFIC_CATALOG_NAME=BraveSoftware
+APP_SPECIFIC_CATALOG_NAME=Aether
 HELPPAGENAME=help
-PRODUCT_LOGO_32=brave/app/theme/brave/product_logo_32.png
-PRODUCT_LOGO_16=brave/app/theme/brave/product_logo_16.png
+PRODUCT_LOGO_32=brave/app/theme/brave/product_logo_32.png
+PRODUCT_LOGO_16=brave/app/theme/brave/product_logo_16.png
diff --git a/brave/app/brave_strings.grd b/brave/app/brave_strings.grd
--- a/brave/app/brave_strings.grd
+++ b/brave/app/brave_strings.grd
@@ -7,11 +7,11 @@
   <release seq="1">
     <messages fallback_to_english="true">
       <message name="IDS_PRODUCT_NAME" desc="The application name">
-        Brave
+        Aether
       </message>
       <message name="IDS_SHORT_PRODUCT_NAME" desc="The application short name">
-        Brave
+        Aether
       </message>
       <message name="IDS_PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION" desc="Browser description">
-        The Brave browser is a fast, free, open source web browser.
+        Aether is a fast, privacy-focused web browser built for clarity.
       </message>
diff --git a/brave/common/brave_channel_info.cc b/brave/common/brave_channel_info.cc
--- a/brave/common/brave_channel_info.cc
+++ b/brave/common/brave_channel_info.cc
@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@
 
 std::string GetChannelName() {
 #if defined(OFFICIAL_BUILD)
-  return "Brave";
+  return "Aether";
 #else
   return "Development";
 #endif
